    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30224" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκατοικ-οδομέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to build in</i> a place, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.18
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>build in, immure</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἔρημον οἰκίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.182
				</span></i>
			:—metaph. in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ [ἀὴρ] ἐν τοῖς ὠσὶν
					ἐγκατῳκοδόμηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					420a9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.3
			</span></i>.</div>
